usage: verify.py [-h] --parents PARENTS --source-root SOURCE_ROOT --prepared
                 PREPARED --output OUTPUT [--archive-replay]
                 [--archive-apks ARCHIVE_APKS]

Independently verify fixed capture provenance and all predetermined pairs.
Evidence completeness has no equality requirement. Every full-frame difference
is retained losslessly. ZIP replay checks saved bytes and the host's
serialized identity records; it does not claim extracted inode/ctime values
are host values.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --parents PARENTS
  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT
  --prepared PREPARED
  --output OUTPUT
  --archive-replay      Compare saved bytes/serialized host metadata; never
                        equate extracted ctime with host ctime
  --archive-apks ARCHIVE_APKS
                        Relocated directory containing the two exact
                        original.apk/candidate.apk bytes, for archive replay
                        only
